        "format": "<style>\n    /* 1. Reset para que Node-RED no interfiera con nuestros márgenes */\n    .nr-dashboard-template {\n        padding: 0 !important;\n        margin: 0 !important;\n        overflow: visible !important; \n    }\n\n    /* 2. Contenedor con MARGEN para crear el efecto de cuadro/marco */\n    .card-marco {\n        position: absolute;\n        /* El secreto: no usar 0, sino dejar unos pixeles de espacio */\n        top: 6px; \n        left: 6px; \n        right: 6px; \n        bottom: 6px; \n        \n        background-color: white;\n        border-radius: 8px; /* Bordes redondeados */\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); /* Sombra que define el marco */\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 15px;\n        transition: all 0.5s ease;\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"card-marco\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">\n        <i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o fa-3x\"\n           ng-style=\"{'color': (msg.payload === 'ON' || msg.payload === true || msg.payload === 'true') ? '#FFD700' : '#444', \n                      'text-shadow': (msg.payload === 'ON' || msg.payload === true || msg.payload === 'true') ? '0 0 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5)' : 'none'}\">\n        </i>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"flex: 2; padding-left: 15px; border-left: 1px solid #eee; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.1em; color: #666; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 2px;\">\n            Iluminación\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"font-size: 2.2em; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.1;\"\n            ng-style=\"{'color': (msg.payload === 'ON' || msg.payload === true || msg.payload === 'true') ? '#28a745' : '#FF0000'}\">\n            {{(msg.payload === 'ON' || msg.payload === true || msg.payload === 'true') ? 'Encendida' : 'Apagada'}}\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
